notes.content:
Hello friends! We are happy to say we have fixed the following issues occuring in the game!

Cutscene 16 wasn't playing background audio;
Position of some character slots of some levels were off;
Adjustment in the animation time of the character slots;
Disc Scratcher Monster card subtitle was incorrect;
Disc Scratcher Monster card title was incorrect;
Special Cat - Real Friend "Elvis" had the wrong nationality;
Metro Monster achievement now has correct text;
Tentacat was duplicated in the card collection;
Only Space Neko appeared in the card collection;
Text was appearing on the back of cards in card collection;

We have also improved the save system. Now it also doesn't occupy too much space in the player's storage.

We want to ensure you have the best experience as possible, so stay tuned, more fixes are on their way!
